      <p>Power for an AI data centre arrives over high-voltage lines from the public grid. In Johor and Singapore, the right to draw that power, not the supply of chips, now decides who gets to build.</p>
      <ul class="reads">{read('the-queue-not-the-chip').map((r) => <li><a href={r.href}>{r.title}</a></li>)}</ul>
